  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EUACI Initiative III - Enhancing Integrity in the defence sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the anti-corruption and integrity framework for defence procurement conducted primarily by Defence Procurement Agency (DPA) and State Operator for Non-Lethal Acquisition of Ukraine (DOT). Enable civil society in promoting a culture of integrity and exposing corruption in defence procurement. Strengthen the capacity of the NACP&#x2019;s Security and Defence Integrity Policy Development Department in monitoring, developing, analysing anti-corruption and integrity policies in the defence and security area. Strengthen the capacity of anti-corruption institutions&#x2014;NABU and SAPO&#x2014;to investigate and prosecute corruption cases in the defence sector.</narrative>
  </description>
